      "instruction": "With some olive oil in a pan, add in 1 tablespoon of tomato paste and cook that down.",
      "duration_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "instruction": "Then add in chopped tomatoes, minced garlic, garlic powder, paprika, red pepper flakes and lentils.",
      "duration_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "instruction": "Pour in some water, cover with a lid and let this cook on a medium low heat for about 20 minutes.",
      "duration_seconds": 1200
    },
    {
      "instruction": "Mash up the tomatoes then crack in 1-2 eggs, cook uncovered for 1 minute and covered for 2 minutes for a runny yolk.",
